Package: kitDesign
Title: Shared 'Shiny' User Interface Components for KIT Research Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-10-31
Authors@R: person("KIT", "Join Tool", email = "joinkit@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The shared user interface layer of the KIT research tools built
    with 'shiny': a 'bslib' theme based on Bootswatch Brite, the KIT style
    sheets and logos, a page wrapper with the KIT header, and documented
    components (page guide, buttons, callouts, status boxes, details rows,
    code panels, step cards, checklists, step tabs, diagrams and tables),
    plus a few server-side helpers (run gate, scroll to result, tab states,
    notifications, number formatting, user-facing errors), value objects
    for status boxes, checklists and code, 'shiny' modules for the stateful
    pieces (step cards, step tabs, run gate, code panel) and a scaffold for
    new apps. Load it with one call to kit_page() and build the page from
    kit_*() components.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/jiewenTsai/kitDesign
BugReports: https://github.com/jiewenTsai/kitDesign/issues
